{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"Eilenberg–MacLane 对象"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"Eilenberg–MacLane空间"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>对正整数 $n$ 与群 $G$ (当 $n&gt;1$ 时要求为 Abel 群), Eilenberg–MacLane 空间 $K(G,n)$ 是同伦等价意义下唯一以 $G$ 为 $n$ 阶"},{"Local":{"url":"同伦群","text":"同伦群"}},{"Plain":"的 $n$-"},{"Local":{"url":"截断性","text":"截断"}},{"Plain":" $(n-1)$-"},{"Local":{"url":"连通性","text":"连通"}},{"Plain":"空间.</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>. 在 "},{"Local":{"url":"意象","text":"$\\infty$-意象"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal C$ 中, 定义 $n$ 阶 <strong>Eilenberg–MacLane 对象</strong>是指<strong>带点</strong> $n$-"},{"Local":{"url":"截断性","text":"截断"}},{"Plain":" $(n-1)$-"},{"Local":{"url":"连通性","text":"连通"}},{"Plain":"对象. 记 $n$ 阶 Eilenberg–MacLane 对象的范畴为 $\\mathsf{EM}_n(\\mathcal C) = \\mathcal C_{*/}^{\\geq n,\\leq n}$.</p>\n<p>Eilenberg–MacLane 对象 $(X,*)$ 被它的 $n$ 阶同伦群 $\\pi_n(X,*)$ 唯一决定. 证明见后文.</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>. Eilenberg–MacLane 对象的定义中<strong>带点</strong>条件很重要. 不带点的 $n$-"},{"Local":{"url":"截断性","text":"截断"}},{"Plain":" $(n-1)$-"},{"Local":{"url":"连通性","text":"连通"}},{"Plain":"对象称为 $n$-"},{"Local":{"url":"束","text":"束"}},{"Plain":" (gerbe).</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p><strong>命题</strong> ("},{"Local":{"url":"LurieHTT","text":"HTT 7.2.2.12"}},{"Plain":").\n设 $\\mathcal C$ 为 "},{"Local":{"url":"∞-意象","text":"$\\infty$-意象"}},{"Plain":", 考虑 $n$ 阶"},{"Local":{"url":"同伦群","text":"同伦群"}},{"Plain":"函子\n$$\r\n\\pi_n = \\tau_{\\leq 0}\\circ \\Omega^n \\colon \\mathcal C_{*/} \\to (\\mathcal C_{*/})_{\\leq 0}.\r\n$$\n那么</p>\n<ul>\n<li>对 $n=0$, $\\pi_0$ 给出了等价 $\\mathsf{EM}_0(\\mathcal C)\\simeq \\mathcal C_{*/}^{\\leq 0}$;</li>\n<li>对 $n=1$, $\\pi_1$ 给出了等价 $\\mathsf{EM}_1(\\mathcal C)\\simeq \\mathsf{Grp}(\\mathcal C_{\\leq 0})$;</li>\n<li>对 $n\\geq 2$, $\\pi_n$ 给出了等价 $\\mathsf{EM}_n(\\mathcal C)\\simeq \\mathsf{Ab}(\\mathcal C_{\\leq 0})$.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>换言之, 在等价\n$$\r\n\\Omega^n \\colon \\mathcal C_{*/}^{\\geq n} \\simeq \\mathsf{Grp}_{\\mathbb E_n}(\\mathcal C)\r\n$$\n中, 两边的子范畴 $\\mathsf{EM}_n(\\mathcal C)$ 与 $\\mathsf{Grp}_{\\mathbb E_n}(\\mathcal C_{\\leq 0})$ 相对应.</p>\n<p>记上述等价的逆为 $K(-,n)$.</p>\n<p><strong>推论</strong>. Eilenberg–MacLane 对象 $K(A,n)$ 是 $A$ 的 $n$ 阶"},{"Local":{"url":"逆环路空间","text":"逆环路空间"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathbf{B}^n A$.</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<h3>一维 CW 复形</h3>\n<p>一维 CW 复形是 $K(G,1)$, 其中 $G$ 为其基本群.</p>\n<h3>射影空间</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>$\\mathbb{R}P^\\infty$ 是 $K(\\mathbb{Z}_2,1)$.</li>\n<li>$\\mathbb{C}P^\\infty$ 是 $K(\\mathbb{Z},2)$.</li>\n</ul>\n"}]}}